sequenceDiagram
    participant T as Expiry task
    participant R as Chat history service
    participant P as PostgreSQL

    Note over T,R: Both run inside the same Agent Runner<br/>One scheduled task and one in-process service
    T->>R: Start scheduled expiry sweep
    R->>P: ChatHistoryDao read transaction<br/>Find a bounded batch of due chats
    P-->>R: Candidate chat IDs and revisions
    loop For each candidate
        R->>P: Same transaction used for Delete<br/>Lock chat and recheck policy and revision
        alt Still due with matching revision
            P->>P: Remove transcript<br/>and write tombstone atomically
            P-->>R: Commit tombstone with new revision
        else Long-term, no longer due, or changed
            P-->>R: Skip chat and leave history unchanged
        end
    end
    R-->>T: Sweep result · expired and skipped counts
